@baseUrl = http://localhost:3200

### Sucesso: morador elegível e período sem conflito
# @name createReservation
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": "resident-1",
  "commonAreaId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-15T18:00:00.000Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-15T22:00:00.000Z"
}

### Impedimento de elegibilidade (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": "resident-ineligible",
  "commonAreaId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-16T18:00:00.000Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-16T22:00:00.000Z"
}

### Entrada inválida (422 pela regra do domínio)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": "resident-1",
  "commonAreaId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-17T22:00:00.000Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z"
}

### Borda HTTP inválida (400 Bad Request por campo ausente ou formato incorreto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": "   ",
  "commonAreaId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "startsAt": "data-invalida",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-20T22:00:00.000Z"
}

### Conflito de agenda (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "residentId": "resident-2",
  "commonAreaId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-15T20:00:00.000Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-15T23:00:00.000Z"
}

### Consulta de reserva por ID (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservas/{{createReservation.response.body.reservationId}}

